      en: ["Located in the city center of Bishkek on Ala-Too Square.", "Features a collection of over 90,000 historical artifacts.", "The cubic building was constructed in 1984 in typical Soviet style.", "Was originally founded in 1927 as the Lenin Museum.", "Houses exhibitions on nomadic culture and lifestyle.", "Recently reopened following a comprehensive multi-year renovation."]
